# SPA fallback + real crawler files.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Pages, which is where this site is deployed, and by any
# other host that supports a `_redirects` file. Without the catch-all below a
# hard refresh on a deep link (/product/<slug>) would 404, because no such file
# exists on disk.
#
# Files that exist on disk always win, so the build-time prerendered pages
# (/product/<slug>/index.html and friends) are served as themselves.

/robots.txt    /robots.txt    200
/sitemap.xml   /sitemap.xml   200
/*             /index.html    200
